.SH NAME
parking\-report\-106 \- offline preview by default; one exact reviewed
input may be submitted explicitly
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B parking\-report\-106
[\fB\-h\fR]
\fB\-\-addresses\fR\ \fIADDRESSES\fR
[\fB\-\-state\-dir\fR\ \fISTATE_DIR\fR]
[\fB\-\-ledger\-dir\fR\ \fILEDGER_DIR\fR]
[\fB\-\-submit\fR]
[\fB\-\-approved\-sha256\fR\ \fIAPPROVED_SHA256\fR]
[\fB\-\-retry\-photo\fR]
[\fB\-\-approved\-followup\-sha256\fR\ \fIAPPROVED_FOLLOWUP_SHA256\fR]
[\fB\-\-approved\-category\-routing\fR\ \fI{crosswalk_parking,blocked_ramp}\fR]
\fIfolder\fR
.SH DESCRIPTION
Offline preview by default; one exact reviewed input may be submitted
explicitly.
.PP
JSON output: one line on stdout for every outcome after successful
argument parsing.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Show this help message and exit.
.TP
\fB\-\-addresses\fR \fIADDRESSES\fR
JSON file with the private address data used to prepare the report.
Required.
.TP
\fB\-\-state\-dir\fR \fISTATE_DIR\fR
Directory for local run state. Default: .106\-state.
.TP
\fB\-\-ledger\-dir\fR \fILEDGER_DIR\fR
Private checked\-out 106\-ledger branch.
.TP
\fB\-\-submit\fR
Submit to the 106 API instead of the offline preview. Live submission
also needs PARKING_106_ENABLE_LIVE=true, the exact \-\-approved\-sha256
and \-\-ledger\-dir; otherwise the run ends blocked.
.TP
\fB\-\-approved\-sha256\fR \fIAPPROVED_SHA256\fR
The reviewed sha256 digest printed by the preview; must match exactly
for a live submission.
.TP
\fB\-\-retry\-photo\fR
Retry the photo attachment of an already submitted case; needs
explicit submission approval.
.TP
\fB\-\-approved\-followup\-sha256\fR \fIAPPROVED_FOLLOWUP_SHA256\fR
Digest approval for a parent\-linked follow\-up manifest; must equal the
reviewed digest.
.TP
\fB\-\-approved\-category\-routing\fR \fI{crosswalk_parking,blocked_ramp}\fR
Deprecated: historical exact routing to 1145; use report.json
municipal_subject. One of: crosswalk_parking, blocked_ramp.
.SS Arguments
.TP
\fIfolder\fR
Report folder holding report.json and its photo.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
\fBPARKING_REPORTER_FIRST_NAME\fR
.TQ
\fBPARKING_REPORTER_LAST_NAME\fR
.TQ
\fBPARKING_REPORTER_PHONE\fR
.TQ
\fBPARKING_REPORTER_ID_NUMBER\fR
.TQ
\fBPARKING_REPORTER_EMAIL\fR
Private reporter details, all required; values are never printed.
.TP
\fBPARKING_106_ENABLE_LIVE\fR
Must be exactly true for a live submission.
.TP
\fBPARKING_106_SUBSCRIPTION_KEY\fR
.TQ
\fBPARKING_106_USERNAME\fR
.TQ
\fBPARKING_106_PASSWORD\fR
Private 106 API credentials, needed only for a live submission.
.TP
\fBPARKING_STATE_GIT\fR
Legacy state\-commit hook; unnecessary with \-\-ledger\-dir.
.SH EXIT STATUS
.TP
.B 0
One JSON line: dry_run or submit result; \-\-help prints argparse help
text instead.
.TP
.B 2
Usage error: argparse usage text on stderr, no JSON.
.TP
.B 4
Blocked: fixed JSON line, no exception text.
.TP
.B 5
Submit succeeded but the duplicate check found a second municipal case
with the same text; case numbers in duplicate_case_numbers.
